    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scramble Heart City is a <strong>3v3 tag-team fighter</strong>\u00a0that's beginner-friendly to pick up and play but features deep team and movement mechanics that reward practice and mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 GAME FEATURES \u2726</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/f66832f7f9126a75f99765982c52af40.poster.avif?t=1754458724\" aria-label=\"Quick Matches &amp; Combo Trials\" width=960 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/f66832f7f9126a75f99765982c52af40.webm?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/f66832f7f9126a75f99765982c52af40.mp4?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 playable characters</strong>, all hand drawn and animated frame by frame.  <br>Dripping in style, and ready to chain up to a super combo.\u00a0     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matchmake online for fast-paced fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice in single player, honing your skills in a tutorial or combo trial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try our comprehensive training mode with hitbox display and frame data measurements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/115d532d63169b43e3917e8fd4b5de22.poster.avif?t=1754458724\" aria-label=\"Beat Up Friends\" width=960 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/115d532d63169b43e3917e8fd4b5de22.webm?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/115d532d63169b43e3917e8fd4b5de22.mp4?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play anywhere with anyone across the world, with cross-play support for browser and Steam. Enjoy <strong>local multiplayer</strong> or <strong>online matchmaking</strong> with private lobbies, spectating, and smooth rollback netcode. <br> <br>Also, that nasty combo you just landed? Yeah, we caught it on tape.   <br>That's the power of <strong>automatic match replays</strong> with easy sharing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/334b55ba50e92749ebf306eb94790c88.poster.avif?t=1754458724\" aria-label=\"Compete &amp; Find Community\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/334b55ba50e92749ebf306eb94790c88.webm?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/334b55ba50e92749ebf306eb94790c88.mp4?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting games are all about community. <br>If you're looking for friends and fighting game fans, you just might find your home here.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign up for our next playtest and play against the dev!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 SUPPORT THE GAME \u2726</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This indie game is a passion project, developed by a competitor and fan of fighting games for 20+ years. Here's how you can help.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Scramble Heart City</strong> to your Steam Wishlist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our <strong>Discord </strong> for the next playtest!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach out</strong> if you want to talk about tournaments, events, or covering the game</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scramble Heart City is a <strong>3v3 tag-team fighter</strong>\u00a0that's beginner-friendly to pick up and play but features deep team and movement mechanics that reward practice and mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 GAME FEATURES \u2726</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/f66832f7f9126a75f99765982c52af40.poster.avif?t=1754458724\" aria-label=\"Quick Matches &amp; Combo Trials\" width=960 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/f66832f7f9126a75f99765982c52af40.webm?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/f66832f7f9126a75f99765982c52af40.mp4?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 playable characters</strong>, all hand drawn and animated frame by frame.  <br>Dripping in style, and ready to chain up to a super combo.\u00a0     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matchmake online for fast-paced fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice in single player, honing your skills in a tutorial or combo trial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try our comprehensive training mode with hitbox display and frame data measurements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/115d532d63169b43e3917e8fd4b5de22.poster.avif?t=1754458724\" aria-label=\"Beat Up Friends\" width=960 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/115d532d63169b43e3917e8fd4b5de22.webm?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/115d532d63169b43e3917e8fd4b5de22.mp4?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play anywhere with anyone across the world, with cross-play support for browser and Steam. Enjoy <strong>local multiplayer</strong> or <strong>online matchmaking</strong> with private lobbies, spectating, and smooth rollback netcode. <br> <br>Also, that nasty combo you just landed? Yeah, we caught it on tape.   <br>That's the power of <strong>automatic match replays</strong> with easy sharing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/334b55ba50e92749ebf306eb94790c88.poster.avif?t=1754458724\" aria-label=\"Compete &amp; Find Community\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/334b55ba50e92749ebf306eb94790c88.webm?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041800/extras/334b55ba50e92749ebf306eb94790c88.mp4?t=1754458724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting games are all about community. <br>If you're looking for friends and fighting game fans, you just might find your home here.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign up for our next playtest and play against the dev!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 SUPPORT THE GAME \u2726</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This indie game is a passion project, developed by a competitor and fan of fighting games for 20+ years. Here's how you can help.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Scramble Heart City</strong> to your Steam Wishlist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our <strong>Discord </strong> for the next playtest!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach out</strong> if you want to talk about tournaments, events, or covering the game</p></li></ul>",
